# Windows Store / MSIX

Goal: MSIX (or msixbundle) from the existing Windows PyInstaller build, then Partner Center submit.

## Current baseline

- CI builds Windows zip + MSIX via `build_gui.yml`
- Stable tag releases run `publish_msix` in `release.yml` (Partner Center upload via `msstore publish`)
- Keep the GitHub Release zip; MSIX Store publish is additive

## Approach

1. Keep PyInstaller onedir
2. Wrap with MakeAppx / MSIX tooling in CI
3. Manifest identity must match Partner Center (Publisher, Name, Version)
4. Secrets only in GitHub org secrets after Partner Center access exists

## Research

Use `microsoft-learn` MCP and project skill `.cursor/skills/windows-store-msix/SKILL.md`. Local notes may live in `mjb_notes/` (gitignored).
